--- !u!114 &1046305067189333782
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1275305898284121118}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: b0f4b7eed39415149a04e027aa5c320a, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  titleText: {fileID: 147499976642063004}
  storyText: {fileID: 3226881021175630824}
  pageIndicatorText: {fileID: 2015510550427622666}
  lorePanel: {fileID: 2592505069555878243}
  gameplayUI: {fileID: 0}
  prevButton: {fileID: 7245804796869855529}
  nextOrSkipButton: {fileID: 5299095271008582616}
  skipButton: {fileID: 5686430078119588853}
  loadSceneOnComplete: 1
  targetSceneName: LevelSelectScene
  autoOpenOnStartInGameplayScene: 0
  storyFontSize: 28
  pages:
  - "<b><size=34><color=#7A1F10>H\u1ED2I 1: KI\u1EBEP TR\u01AF\u1EDAC \u2014 S\u1EF0
    PH\u1EA2N B\u1ED8I</color></size></b>\n\nCow L\u1ED1p t\u1EEBng l\xE0 m\u1ED9t
    ch\xE0ng trai b\xECnh th\u01B0\u1EDDng, h\u1EBFt l\xF2ng y\xEAu th\u01B0\u01A1ng
    ng\u01B0\u1EDDi con g\xE1i c\u1EE7a m\xECnh v\xE0 tin t\u01B0\u1EDFng tuy\u1EC7t
    \u0111\u1ED1i v\xE0o ng\u01B0\u1EDDi b\u1EA1n th\xE2n nh\u1EA5t.\n\nR\u1ED3i
    m\u1ED9t ng\xE0y, anh b\xE0ng ho\xE0ng ph\xE1t hi\u1EC7n s\u1EF1 th\u1EADt ph\u0169
    ph\xE0ng: ch\xEDnh ng\u01B0\u1EDDi y\xEAu v\xE0 ng\u01B0\u1EDDi b\u1EA1n th\xE2n
    \u1EA5y \u0111\xE3 ph\u1EA3n b\u1ED9i anh sau l\u01B0ng. Kh\xF4ng o\xE1n h\u1EADn,
    kh\xF4ng tr\u1EA3 th\xF9, anh l\u1EB7ng l\u1EBD r\u1EDDi \u0111i \u2014 \u0111\u1EC3
    r\u1ED3i g\u1EE5c ng\xE3 trong c\xF4 \u0111\u01A1n v\xE0 tuy\u1EC7t v\u1ECDng
    gi\u1EEFa \u0111\xEAm m\u01B0a t\u1EA7m t\xE3."
  - "<b><size=34><color=#7A1F10>H\u1ED2I 2: TR\u1ECCNG SINH \u2014 TR\u1EDE V\u1EC0
    QU\xC1 KH\u1EE8</color></size></b>\n\nKhi m\u1EDF m\u1EAFt ra, Cow L\u1ED1p nh\u1EADn
    ra m\xECnh \u0111\xE3 tr\u1EDF v\u1EC1 c\u0103n ph\xF2ng tr\u1ECD t\u1ED3i t\xE0n
    c\u1EE7a 10 n\u0103m tr\u01B0\u1EDBc. M\u1ECDi th\u1EE9 v\u1EABn ch\u01B0a m\u1EA5t
    h\u1EBFt.\n\nM\u1ED9t th\u1EF1c th\u1EC3 b\xED \u1EA9n t\u1EF1 x\u01B0ng l\xE0
    <b>\"H\u1EC7 Th\u1ED1ng\"</b> xu\u1EA5t hi\u1EC7n, ban cho anh c\u01A1 h\u1ED9i
    th\u1EE9 hai \u0111\u1EC3 \"s\u1EEDa ch\u1EEFa sai l\u1EA7m\". Nh\u01B0ng n\xF3
    ch\u1EB3ng h\u1EC1 t\u1ED1t b\u1EE5ng \u2014 n\xF3 \xE9p anh l\xE0m nh\u1EEFng
    nhi\u1EC7m v\u1EE5 k\u1EF3 qu\u1EB7c \u0111\u1EC3 thao t\xFAng h\xE0nh vi, h\xF2ng
    l\u1ED9 r\xF5 b\u1EA3n ch\u1EA5t l\xE0 hi\u1EC7n th\xE2n c\u1EE7a nh\u1EEFng
    t\u1ED5n th\u01B0\u01A1ng qu\xE1 kh\u1EE9 \u0111ang t\xECm c\xE1ch chi\u1EBFm
    \u0111o\u1EA1t linh h\u1ED3n v\xE0 thay th\u1EBF anh."
  - "<b><size=34><color=#7A1F10>H\u1ED2I 3: TR\u1EACN CHI\u1EBEN SINH T\u1EEC</color></size></b>\n\n\u0110\u1EC3
    gi\u1EA3i tho\xE1t b\u1EA3n th\xE2n kh\u1ECFi v\xF2ng l\u1EB7p bi k\u1ECBch,
    Cow L\u1ED1p bu\u1ED9c ph\u1EA3i \u0111\u1ED1i m\u1EB7t v\u1EDBi c\xE1c <b>\"Qu\u1EF7
    N\u1ED9i T\xE2m\"</b>: <i>Qu\u1EF7 Ghen Tu\xF4ng, Qu\u1EF7 \u0110au Kh\u1ED5,
    Qu\u1EF7 T\u1EF1 Ti</i> v\xE0 <i>Qu\u1EF7 Gi\u1EADn D\u1EEF</i>.\n\n\u0110\u1EC9nh
    \u0111i\u1EC3m l\xE0 tr\u1EADn chi\u1EBFn sinh t\u1EED v\u1EDBi \u0111\u1ED1i
    th\u1EE7 <b>N\u1EEF \xE1o \u0111\u1ECF</b> \u2014 hi\u1EC7n th\xE2n c\u1EE7a
    s\u1EF1 ph\u1EA3n b\u1ED9i v\xE0 n\u1ED7i \u0111au n\u0103m x\u01B0a \u2014 \u0111\u1EC3
    \u0111\u1ECBnh \u0111o\u1EA1t xem ai s\u1EBD ph\xE1 hu\u1EF7 \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c
    linh h\u1ED3n (b\u1EE9c t\u01B0\u1EE3ng) c\u1EE7a \u0111\u1ED1i ph\u01B0\u01A1ng
    tr\u01B0\u1EDBc, ch\u1EA5m d\u1EE9t m\u1ECDi \u0111au th\u01B0\u01A1ng."
